ioning xylophone in my notes, please?\", \"And what does my calendar have on it, please?\", \"Would you mind moving both of them to friday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0014\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me the documents in my Subscriptions folder, please?\", \"Please star the Laex one.\"], [\"Subscriptions folder docs\", \"star the Laex one\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0015\", \"v\": [[\"centre wifi locker entry\", \"Salcombe documents?\", \"nah, leave it\"], [\"can u find the centre wifi entry in my locker\", \"diff thing, got any Salcombe documents\", \"nah leave it thx\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0016\", \"v\": [[\"centre wifi password?\"], [\"uh what's the actual, um, centre wifi password?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0017\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me which pictures are in the Ardnamurchan Deli album, please?\", \"Could you narrow that to just the ones from last week?\"], [\"umm what pics are in the Ardnamurchan Deli album?\", \"ok just the ones from, uh, last week\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0018\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you show me the… the Craly tax password?\"], [\"I'm filling in a form and it's making me log in again, so could you reveal the Craly tax password for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0019\", \"v\": [[\"umm so Dreford, I visited them, can you log that?\", \"and uh, what are their contact details?\", \"ok different thing — which Seswick expenses were, like, over one hundred pesos?\"], [\"pls log it, Dreford — i visited them\", \"whats their contact info\", \"also which Seswick expenses were over one hundred pesos\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w13-0020\", \"v\": [[\"Losuan in Wasoe, wanna settle up pls\"], [\"Could you help me with Losuan in Wasoe? I'd like to settle up, please.\"]]}","ttft_ms":26671,"type":"result","duration_ms":37020,"uuid":"984bdf3e-66b9-41a7-ac8a-ecdfb6a738df","ttft_stream_ms":1331,"time_to_request_ms":123,"first_content_frame_ms":1332,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22037644,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278588109.469,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
